==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 5.33~10.67 seconds<sup>160f~320f</sup>.
*10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 4.67~9.33 seconds<sup>140f~280f</sup>.
*10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There is but a single Le'noir that stands in your way of beating this stage, however the Wafer Cat XLs that accompany him lust for blood. Simply outlive and outlast the horrific onslaught and kill Le'noir with strong nukers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], before you crumble under the weight like a cookie.

